  <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm">
    <li><a class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" href="/api/health">/api/health</a> - endpoint de sante</li>
    <li><a class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" href="/en/">English version</a></li>
  </ul>
</Base>
